  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 16942796800
    m_Localized: Flashlight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17077014528
    m_Localized: It's a flashlight. Without it, I can't see a thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17077014529
    m_Localized: Bolt cutter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17077014530
    m_Localized: These are bolt cutters that can cut through chains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208832
    m_Localized: Switchboard password
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208833
    m_Localized: 'The password is written here: 1318.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208834
    m_Localized: Door opener
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208835
    m_Localized: This is a tool that can open the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208836
    m_Localized: USB
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208837
    m_Localized: This USB drive contains the experiment data. Once power is restored,
      let's plug it into a computer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208838
    m_Localized: 6
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208839
    m_Localized: This is the number 6 I saw in the power control room. What does
      it mean?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208840
    m_Localized: 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208841
    m_Localized: This is the number 1 I saw in the heating control room. Are there
      any more?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208842
    m_Localized: 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208843
    m_Localized: This is the number 3 I saw beyond the dormitory door. What does
      it mean?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208844
    m_Localized: Ladder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208845
    m_Localized: With this, I should be able to climb up into the ventilation shaft.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208846
    m_Localized: Key Card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208847
    m_Localized: There probably are doors that can be opened with a key card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208848
    m_Localized: Lab Password
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208849
    m_Localized: This is a note someone left behind. Let's think carefully about
      the order in which to search.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208850
    m_Localized: 'Experiment Log

      Test Subject: DE5i1

      We attempted to
      observe the subject using all available imaging equipment, including X-rays,
      CT scans, MRIs, and cameras, but no discernible internal structure was found.

      However,
      it was confirmed that the subject exhibits behavior similar to that of living
      organisms, such as reacting to external stimuli.

      In particular, it was
      observed to react sensitively to light and sound.


      Experiment Log

      Test
      Subject: DE5i1

      Mice, rabbits, and bears were introduced into the laboratory
      sequentially.

      The dates of introduction were June X, July X, and August
      X.

      Immediately after the test subject was discovered, all test animals
      exhibited extreme fear reactions.

      After observing the test animals for
      a certain period of time, DE5i1 displayed aggressive behavior.

      Following
      the attack, the animals'' bodies were so severely mutilated that their forms
      could no longer be identified, and shortly thereafter, they mutated into black
      masses.

      This black substance is designated as "Fomes."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208851
    m_Localized: 'Experiment Log

      Test Subject: DE5i1

      Researcher A observed
      and reported that test subject DE5i1 split into two parts and then merged back
      into a single entity.

      Since DE5i1 possesses the characteristic of not
      being recorded by CCTV, no evidence of the incident was secured. Consequently,
      researchers took turns monitoring the test subject thereafter.

      Subsequently,
      Researcher B also confirmed that DE5i1 split.

      As the same phenomenon
      has been repeatedly observed, the splitting of DE5i1 is now considered a confirmed
      fact, and follow-up experiments will proceed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208852
    m_Localized: 'Report

      Based on a comprehensive analysis of existing experimental
      records, it is estimated that the division phenomenon of DE5i1 occurs after
      administration to animals.

      To verify this hypothesis, we propose conducting
      additional animal administration experiments.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208853
    m_Localized: '15th Experiment Report

      Test Subject: Fomes

      15th Experiment
      - Combustion Reaction Experiment

      We ignited Fomes to observe the combustion
      reaction.

      When compared to an equal volume of coal, it was confirmed
      that combustion lasted approximately 80 to 100 times longer.


      Supervisor''s
      Comments: Significant experimental results were confirmed. It is judged to
      have potential for use as an alternative fuel, and further experiments are
      requested.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208854
    m_Localized: '13th Experiment Report

      Test Subject: DE5i1

      13th Experiment
      - XX Reaction Experiment

      When an XX stimulus was applied to DE5i1, a
      substance resembling a long, red thread appeared.

      Although its appearance
      was identical to the red threads typically observed, its length was confirmed
      to be approximately 4 to 6 times longer than usual.


      Supervisor''s Comments:
      A new form of red thread has been identified. I request that additional observations
      and experiments be conducted on this red thread.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208855
    m_Localized: 'Top-Secret Experiment Report

      Test Subject: DE5i1

      Mentem
      Regere Experiment-Follow-up Experiment Following the 13th XX Stimulus-Response
      Experiment


      A rabbit was introduced after the XX stimulus was applied.
      An abnormal reaction was observed in the rabbit that came into contact with
      the red thread.

      Subsequently, when the researcher who had applied the
      stimulus issued a command, the rabbit was observed to obey it. It did not respond
      to commands from other researchers.


      In the second experiment, a death
      row inmate was introduced, and the XX stimulus was applied. Similarly, the
      subject was observed to respond only to commands from the researcher who administered
      the stimulus.

      Based on these results, it is concluded that the XX stimulus
      allows for direct control over the subject''s behavior.


      The process
      of controlling a subject''s mind and behavior through the XX stimulus is named
      Mentem Regere, abbreviated as Mentem.

      A subject controlled by Mentem
      is designated as a Servus.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208856
    m_Localized: 'Top-Secret Experiment Report

      Test Subject: Servus

      Servus
      exhibits the characteristic of responding only to commands given by researchers
      who have performed a "Mentem" on it.

      I gave Servus the command "Fly."
      Servus moved to a high place and then jumped down.

      It appears to attempt
      to carry out even commands that are impossible to execute.

      Subsequently,
      the command "XX" was issued to Servus.

      Immediately after the command,
      a phenomenon occurred in which space warped within a radius of approximately
      20 meters centered on Servus. Shortly thereafter, it was observed that the
      environment within that radius had been destroyed.

      Although the destruction
      resembled that caused by an explosion, the exact process of the event could
      not be confirmed. This phenomenon was also not recorded normally by the camera.


      Experiments
      related to Mentem and Servus are classified as top secret. Certain terms and
      commands are designated as Level 1 classified, and access to them is restricted.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208857
    m_Localized: Director
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208858
    m_Localized: Laboratory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208859
    m_Localized: Lounge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208860
    m_Localized: Security
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208861
    m_Localized: Equipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208862
    m_Localized: Server
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208863
    m_Localized: Lobby
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208864
    m_Localized: Lab Hall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208865
    m_Localized: Dorm Hall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208866
    m_Localized: Central Control
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208867
    m_Localized: Research
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208868
    m_Localized: Storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208869
    m_Localized: Dormitory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208870
    m_Localized: ...Where am I?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208871
    m_Localized: Why am I here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208872
    m_Localized: First of all... let me look around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208873
    m_Localized: What on earth was that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208874
    m_Localized: What kind of place was that over there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208875
    m_Localized: Why was I there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208876
    m_Localized: There's one thing that's really bothering me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208877
    m_Localized: They say that monster crushes its victims beyond recognition,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208878
    m_Localized: so what are all those bodies then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208879
    m_Localized: There's one thing I think I understand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208880
    m_Localized: Those people tried to use that monster, but ultimately failed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208881
    m_Localized: Did that failure lead to this carnage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208882
    m_Localized: I found a bolt cutter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208883
    m_Localized: I found a key card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208884
    m_Localized: With this, I think I can dismantle the main gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208885
    m_Localized: I got a ladder. I should be able to climb up the ventilation shaft,
      right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208886
    m_Localized: I can't open the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17081208887
    m_Localized: I need a key card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403136
    m_Localized: I need to restore power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403137
    m_Localized: I'm coming to my senses. Let's turn on the lights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403138
    m_Localized: 'There''s a chain here.

      Let''s find a bolt cutter.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403139
    m_Localized: With a ladder, I think I can climb up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403140
    m_Localized: 'There''s a bookshelf.

      There are science fiction novels,
      magazines, and a Bible.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403141
    m_Localized: 'Human greed knows no bounds,

      it even encroaches upon the
      realm of the divine.


      But...


      For the common good... yes, for
      the greater good,

      there are times when one must set aside one''s conscience.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403142
    m_Localized: Chasing the light...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403143
    m_Localized: Rapidly press the interaction key to break the glass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403144
    m_Localized: Rapidly press the interaction key to dismantle the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403145
    m_Localized: 'Researcher 1: Do you know how to manually disassemble a door?


      Researcher
      2: Why would you want to open a door manually?


      Researcher 1: I saw
      it in a movie-they used a hydraulic opener to open a broken steel door. And
      I noticed we have the exact same opener in the warehouse.


      Researcher
      2: Are you trying to shoot *Mission: Impossible* or something?


      Researcher
      1: Why? Those bulletin boards have manuals explaining what to do if the power
      goes out. Since this place has its own power generator, and those manuals are
      posted repeatedly, I''m just thinking "just in case."


      Researcher 2:
      Stop talking nonsense and get back to writing your report. We have an experiment
      tomorrow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403146
    m_Localized: 'To whoever is reading this:

      I''m sorry. We failed.

      No,
      maybe we were arrogant from the start.

      We thought we could control that
      monster.

      But it turned out to be the opposite.

      I''m sorry. I''m
      sorry. I''m so s'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403147
    m_Localized: '[In Case of a Power Problem]

      If the power is unstable,

      check
      the distribution panel in the underground power

      control room.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403148
    m_Localized: '[In the Event of a Power Outage]

      In the event of a power
      outage, the emergency generator will start up.

      Please calmly check the
      power control room.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403149
    m_Localized: I see the number 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403150
    m_Localized: '[Research room Usage Guidelines]

      This lab is a space designated
      for writing reports and performing administrative tasks.

      Please use
      the computers for work purposes only.


      *Do not play games on the computers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403151
    m_Localized: 'Researcher 1: What on earth is that test subject, DE5i1?


      Researcher
      2: I asked my senior about it briefly, and he said it seems like no one knows
      what it really is-not even the head of the project. Just looking at its appearance,
      it looks like a demon.


      Researcher 1: Exactly. This is the first time
      I''ve ever believed in demons or ghosts since I came here. Is it really a demon?


      Researcher
      2: Maybe figuring out its true nature is the whole point of the research.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403152
    m_Localized: 'I will now restore power and search for survivors.

      I received
      a radio transmission from the basement of the living quarters, so I plan to
      search there first before moving on to the dormitory.

      I''ve changed
      the access code for the lab entrance. I''ll leave the new code behind as I
      search, so please take care of things after I''m gone.


      P.S.: I took
      this precaution because the test subject appears to be quite intelligent. I''m
      not sure if it will make a difference, but please be extremely careful.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17085403153
    m_Localized: This is a summary of the initial experiment. Please review it after
      checking it over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
